{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"生成基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"noise-functions","title":"噪声函数原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals/noise-functions","wordCount":1914,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"fbm-heightmap","title":"分形布朗运动与高度图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals/fbm-heightmap","wordCount":1445,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"heightmap-generation","title":"高度图生成技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/fundamentals/heightmap-generation","wordCount":1530,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生成基础\">生成基础</h1><p>程序化地形生成的数学根基：噪声函数的频谱理论、分形布朗运动的多倍频叠加机制，以及高度图作为地形数据结构的存储规范与坐标系约定。本章建立的概念框架是后续所有地形算法的共同语言。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"noise-functions\">噪声函数原理</a></td>\n<td>Perlin 噪声、Simplex 噪声的梯度场构造与频谱特性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"fbm-heightmap\">分形布朗运动与高度图</a></td>\n<td>fBm 多倍频叠加、高度图存储格式与坐标系规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"heightmap-generation\">高度图生成技术</a></td>\n<td>菱形-方形算法、域变形、高度重映射技巧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}